WEBVTT

00:10:58.246 --> 00:11:04.162
a researcher, I found my mistakes
very instructive.

00:11:04.537 --> 00:11:08.204
And and there were sort of positive
experiences. By and large.

00:11:08.621 --> 00:11:11.829
It's such an odd thing to hear
you say, because most of us,

00:11:12.162 --> 00:11:14.621
most of us experience pain, not pleasure.

00:11:15.079 --> 00:11:17.287
When, you know, when we find
out that we're wrong

00:11:17.287 --> 00:11:19.662
or we discover that we've made a mistake.

00:11:20.079 --> 00:11:24.162
So how did you arrive at a place where you
found that to be a teachable moment?

00:11:24.704 --> 00:11:29.537
Well, you know, those are situations
in which you are surprised.